r>           </li><li>Chances of getting multiple Illnesses from Battle and while exploring!<br>           </li><li>and more..<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/418430/extras/1a6296c6a32ad1fc9b6d57ceda5e3d45.avif?t=1735158440\" /></div><br></li><li>Environment Chances which effects Miolhria in many ways!<br></li><li>Coming Soon Environmental Situations (Wind Storms may have a Chance of causing a Tornado)<br></li><li>More to Come...Stay Tuned!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>Stay up to date with us by wishlisting our game, keep up with the latest updates and more!!!<br>Discord Coming 2023!</li></ul>",
